      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Zoetis is the clear leader in the global animal health industry. Its revenue was <span data-field="zoetis_revenue">{{ zoetis_revenue }}</span> percent more than that of its closest competitors. Zoetis is one of the few companies that has successfully navigated the complex and evolving landscape of animal health.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">The company's focus on research and development has allowed it to maintain a strong competitive advantage. Its portfolio includes a wide range of products for livestock, companion animals, and other animals.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <div class="section-title">Business Description Company: Zoetis Inc. is a global leader in the discovery, development, manufacture, and marketing of animal health medicines and vaccines. The company's products are used to treat a wide variety of animals, including livestock, companion animals, and other animals. Zoetis has a strong focus on research and development, which allows it to stay ahead of the competition. The company's products are used by veterinarians and farmers around the world.</div>
