  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-title">Trends Driving Industry Growth:</div>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">The global animal health industry is experiencing significant growth, driven by several factors. One of the most important is the increasing awareness of pet owners about the health and well-being of their animals. This has led to a surge in demand for premium pet care products.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Furthermore, the global livestock industry is growing, and there is a constant need for effective animal health solutions to ensure productivity and prevent disease outbreaks.</p>
